{"version":1,"key":"card:750","content":{"id":750,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当用户点击页面内的锚点链接或「返回顶部」按钮时，浏览器默认会瞬间跳转到目标位置，体验上比较生硬。CSS 提供了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"scroll-behavior","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性来解决这个问题，只需要一行声明就能让页面滚动变得平滑。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"它的取值很简单："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"auto","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：浏览器的默认行为，瞬间滚动完成"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"smooth","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：平滑滚动"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最常见的用法是直接设置在 html 元素上，这样页面中所有通过锚点触发的滚动都会变得平滑："}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"html {\n  scroll-behavior: smooth;\n}","language":"CSS","uuid":"9c0d2f11-7297-41cc-bb39-d62e1171e5df","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"比如页面中有一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"<a href=\"#top\">返回顶部</a>","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的锚点链接，配合上面的声明，点击后就会平滑地滚回页面顶部，而不是生硬地跳转。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不过需要注意的是，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"scroll-behavior","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不支持自定义滚动时长和缓动函数，浏览器会按自己的默认节奏完成动画。另外它只影响导航或程序脚本触发的滚动，不会干扰用户通过鼠标滚轮、触摸板等人为操作产生的滚动。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 JavaScript 中也有一些可以触发滚动的函数："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"window.scrollTo","code":true}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"window.scrollBy","code":true}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"element.scrollTo","code":true}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"element.scrollBy","code":true}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"element.scrollIntoView","code":true}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这些函数可以和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"scroll-behavior","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 配合实现平滑滚动，不过它们自身也接受 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"behavior","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 参数来配置滚动行为。建议在调用时显式设置，代码意图更清晰，也更容易维护："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"element.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \"smooth\", block: \"start\", inline: \"nearest\" });","uuid":"8876b143-9aca-43e1-9326-ea6f0d200298","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["CSS/scroll-behavior"],"createTime":1780375731433,"updateTime":1780376560883,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1780376560883}}